# LLM Tailoring Readiness Monitor

This watcher is intentionally a no-op until provider credentials are present.

Paths:
- Write target: `outreach_monitor/processed/llm_tailoring_readiness.json`
- Update this file when any supported provider env set is configured:
  - `ZION_LLM_API_ENDPOINT`, `ZION_LLM_API_KEY`, `ZION_LLM_MODEL`
  - or `OPENROUTER_API_KEY`
  - or `GROQ_API_KEY`
  - or `GEMINI_API_KEY`

Best practice:
- Add secrets via repository settings or secure runtime env
- Keep fallback replies active during credential failure
- Do not store raw secrets in this file or repo
